      "| RTX A5000 | 24GB | $0.22 | 1 | - |\n",
      "| GeForce RTX 3090 | 24GB | $0.27 | 39 | - |\n",
      "| GeForce RTX 4090 | 24GB | $0.30 | 3 | - |\n",
