    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[USER] 我想知道现在有没有 H100 可以用，如果有的话多少钱一小时？\n",
      "\n",
      "[GLM-5.1] 我来帮你查询 H100 的可用情况和价格信息！\n",
      "\n",
      "[TOOL CALL] vmaas_get_hardware_list({\"gpu\": \"H100\"})\n",
      "\n",
      "[TOOL RESULT] (2109 chars):\n",
      "{\n",
      "  \"service\": \"vmaas\",\n",
      "  \"operation\": \"get_hardware_list\",\n",
      "  \"data\": {\n",
      "    \"data\": {\n",
      "      \"hardware\": [\n",
      "        {\n",
      "          \"id\": \"gpu_4x_h100__US\",\n",
      "          \"deploy_id\": \"gpu_4x_h100\",\n",
      "          \"name\": \"H100\",\n",
      "          \"num_cards\": 4,\n",
