      "          \"memory\": 512,\n",
      "          \"location\": \"US\"\n",
      "      ...\n",
      "\n",
      "[TOOL CALL] caas_get_hardware_ids({})\n",
      "\n",
      "[TOOL RESULT] (19709 chars):\n",
      "{\n",
      "  \"service\": \"caas\",\n",
      "  \"operation\": \"get_hardware_ids\",\n",
      "  \"data\": {\n",
      "    \"data\": [\n",
      "      {\n",
      "        \"max_gpus_per_container\": 4,\n",
      "        \"min_gpus_per_container\": null,\n",
      "        \"available\": 1,\n",
      "        \"network\": 1,\n",
      "        \"hardware_id\": \"V100_32Gx4\",\n",
      "        \"hardware_name\": \"V100_32G\",\n",
      "        \"location\": \"US\",\n",
      "        \"brand_name\": \"NVIDIA\",\n",
      "        \"price\": 9.36,\n",
      "        \"confidential_compute\": false\n",
      "      },\n",
      "      {\n",
      "        \"max_gpus_per_container\": 4,\n",
      "        \"min_gpus_per_container\": null...\n",
      "\n",
      "[ANSWER]\n",
      "好消息，H100 目前有货可用！以下是所有 H100 配置的详情：\n",
      "\n",
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "### 🖥️ H100 PCIe 系列（美国）\n",
      "\n",
      "| GPU 数量 | 价格/小时 | vCPU | 内存 | 存储 | VRAM/卡 |\n",
      "|---------|---------|------|-----|------|---------|\n",
      "| 1 卡 | **$1.848** | 20 | 128 GB | 1,250 GB | 80 GB |\n",
      "| 2 卡 | **$3.696** | 40 | 256 GB | 2,500 GB | 80 GB |\n",
      "| 4 卡 | **$7.392** | 64 | 512 GB | 5,000 GB | 80 GB |\n",
      "\n",
      "### 🖥️ H100 SXM5 系列（单卡）\n",
      "\n",
      "| 地区 | 价格/小时 | vCPU | 内存 | 存储 | VRAM/卡 |\n",
      "|-----|---------|------|-----|------|---------|\n",
      "| 🇨🇦 加拿大 | **$3.34** | 20 | 240 GB | 4,400 GB | 80 GB |\n",
      "| 🇳🇱 荷兰 | **$3.34** | 20 | 240 GB | 4,400 GB | 80 GB |\n",
      "\n",
      "### 🐳 容器服务（CaaS）独享价格\n",
      "\n",
      "| 型号 | 可用数量 | 价格/小时 |\n",
      "|------|---------|---------|\n",
      "| H100 80GB PCIe | **150 台** | **$1.00** |\n",
      "| H100 80GB HBM3 | **120 台** | **$2.09** |\n",
      "\n",
      "---\n",
      "\n",
      "**总结：**\n",
      "- 💰 **最便宜**：H100 80GB PCIe（容器服务），仅需 **$1.00/小时**\n",
      "- 🔥 **最灵活**：PCIe 系列支持 1~4 卡部署，适合多卡训练场景\n",
      "- ⚡ **SXM5 版本**：带宽更高，适合大规模分布式训练，在加拿大和荷兰可用\n",
      "\n",
      "需要我帮你部署吗？\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "answer = await agent_chat('我想知道现在有没有 H100 可以用，如果有的话多少钱一小时？', tools)"
   ]
  },
